      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dales%2C_California",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "After the flood, the Dales leased the spot as a restaurant and bar, selling it in 1962.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
