      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dales%2C_California",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The station was bought in 2006, restored, and reopened as a restaurant in November 2010.",
